{
  "id": 917,
  "description": "⭐️\n\nFeel Free to Apply \n\n-Join our Discord🥳\n\nhttps://discord.gg/aMDTTseXd5 (optional)\n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️\n\n\nWe are taking new members that will participate in raids and contributions. (I can remove my alts) (preferably 80 combat to participate in raids)\n\n⭐️\n\nCasual guild with a focus on providing quality of life improvements. ⚔️🛡️\n\n We only ask you : \n\n-Stay active\n\n⚠️ (kick after 7 days offline or no guild participation in the last 14 days, just do some raids or a challenge once) ⚠️\n\n-Participate in Guild Raids or Donations\n\n-Complete Challenges for marks. \n\n(40 marks needed per week total for all raids/pools)\n\n-Donate to the stockpile when you can 🤙\n\n(Try and keep everything in the 10-15k range min )\n\n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️\n\nThe Energizing Pool is active from : 🧚⛲️\n\n-Every Saturday and Sunday (if marks above 50)\n\n-9am-12pm(Lunch) (GMT-8)   \n\n (requires 5 marks each use)\n\n(Visit guild and activate for a 2 hour buff during that time. ⏰)\n\nGetting membership through market is encouraged. \n(Bonus XP and Idle Time ⏰ 💹)\n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️\n\nRaids daily when available 5-7 P.M. (GMT-8)\n\n-❗️Level 80 (5PM) Celestial Observatory (60 min) 🔭\n\nS-M-T-W-T-F-S\n\n-❗️Level 92 (7PM) Isle of Whispers (67 min) 🏝️  (Wednesday if marks above 50)\n\nS—W-F-S\n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️\n\nResources needed every 2 weeks to keep guild upgrades functioning. (Will get exact numbers for base requirements)\n\nOak Log - 1400 (unity seal/raid planner)\n\nYew Log - 1100 (energizing pool/conquest banner)\n\nSpruce Log - 3300(energizing pool/raid planner)\n\nBirch Log - 800 (unity seal)\n\nMaple Log - 4700 (energizing pool/conquest banner/raid planner)\n\nMahogany Log - 800 (unity seal)\n\nMystical Log - 4400 (energizing pool/conquest banner/raid planner)\n\n—————————————————————\n\nCopper Bar - 1900 (conquest banner/unity seal)\n\nIron Bar - 3000(energizing pool/raid planner)\n\nSteel Bar - 1900 (conquest banner/unity seal)\n\nMercury Bar - 1600(energizing pool)\n\nChromite Bar - 1100(raid planner)\n\nUranium Bar - 2700(energizing pool/conquest banner)\n\nMystic Bar - 800 (conquest banner)\n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️\n\nUpgrades : \n\n1 -Energizing pool 🏖️ COMPLETE ✅\n\n2 -Unity Seal ⚛️ COMPLETE ✅\n\n3 -Raid Planner 🐲 COMPLETE ✅\n\n4 -Conquest Banner ⛳️ COMPLETE ✅\n\n5 -Armory 🏹⚔️🛡️\n\n6 -Teleportation Beacon (slot needed) 🪄\n\n7 -Mission Table (slot needed) 🗺️ \n\n⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️⬇️",
